        "original_id": "6e8e0f9e-8494-55c5-abd9-d0fbfccb682e",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jack Lowden, Jason Connery, Peter Mullan\n- Films and TV: Tommy's Honour, War & Peace\n- Roles: actor, director\n\nFacts:\n- Jack Andrew Lowden was born on 2 June 1990 and is a Scottish stage, television, and film actor.\n- Jack Lowden had a highly successful and award-winning four-year stage career before his first major international onscreen success.\n- In 2016, Jack Lowden's first major international onscreen success came in the BBC miniseries \"War & Peace\", which led to starring roles in feature films.\n- The film \"Tommy's Honour\" was directed by Jason Connery.\n- In \"Tommy's Honour\", Peter Mullan and Jack Lowden portrayed the father and son.",
